          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 17,
          "bbox": [
            0.149,
            0.668,
            0.636,
            0.742
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Let us now see where the smallest number 1 and the largest number 9 should come in a magic square. Our second observation tells us that they will have to come in one of the boundary"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 18,
